    "A phrase can have several meanings. Each entry focuses on one sense, its word order, and its conversational use. Examples and explanations were written for vow; this is not a reproduction of the PHaVE list.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ひとつの表現に、複数の意味があることもあります。各項目では、ひとつの意味と、その語順や会話での使い方を学びます。例文と説明はvow向けに作成したもので、PHaVEリストの転載ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder will be scheduled when a learned phrase is due for review.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "学んだ表現の復習時期に合わせて、通知を予約します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A voice for this language is unavailable. Add it in iOS Settings, or turn off spoken meanings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A voice for this language is unavailable. Add it in iOS Settings, or turn off spoken meanings."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この言語の音声がありません。iOSの設定で音声を追加するか、意味の読み上げをオフにしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
