    "That recording was very short. Try a full reply, or type it instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "録音が短すぎました。回答を最後まで録音するか、文字で入力してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current phrase collection spans A1–C1. A different meaning of the same phrase may have a different level.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在の収録表現はA1〜C1です。同じ表現でも、意味によって難易度が異なる場合があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Theme"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テーマ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is guided solo practice, not a live conversation partner or an automatic pronunciation assessment. Try one phrase in a real conversation, and notice how the other person responds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このアプリは、一人で練習するためのガイドです。相手と会話したり、発音を自動評価したりする機能はありません。覚えた表現を実際の会話でひとつ使い、相手の反応にも目を向けてみてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording couldn't be played. Try recording again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "録音を再生できませんでした。もう一度録音してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timers: 60, 45 and 30 seconds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "制限時間は60秒、45秒、30秒です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To restore Vow Pro, use Restore purchases in Settings or on the purchase screen with the Apple Account used for the original purchase. Restoring purchases does not transfer learning history.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vow Proを復元するには、購入時と同じApple Accountを使い、設定または購入画面の「購入を復元」を押してください。購入を復元しても、学習履歴は移行されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
