    "vow does not require an account and has no advertising or analytics SDKs. The developer does not receive your practice audio, replies, notes, or progress.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "vowはアカウント登録が不要で、広告やアクセス解析のSDKも使用していません。練習の音声、返答、メモ、学習記録が開発者に送られることはありません。"
